{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "The Shopping Spree", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Real Leather", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 3, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 7, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.3", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Identify and describe taste and style in fashion through a wider range of language in both work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Making Comparisons", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the structure <span class=\"italic\">as ... as</span> with adjectives and adverbs to compare things that are the same :<br/><span class=\"italic\">This leather jacket is <span class=\"strong\">as soft as</span> a sweater!</span><br/><br/>You use <span class=\"italic\">not as ... as</span> to compare things things that aren't equal:<br/><span class=\"italic\">This leather jacket <span class=\"strong\">isn't as expensive as</span> that one.</span>", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "I don't look as slim as I did last year. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Green is not as easy to wear as blue or rust or rose.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You need something that is not as fussy as this is.", "type": "example"}, {"content": " She's as good as they get.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I'll take these to give you as much room as possible.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Responses with <span class=\"italic\">So</span> and <span class=\"italic\">Neither</span>", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"italic\">so</span> and <span class=\"italic\">neither</span> for positive and negative agreement.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"italic\">so</span>  to show agreement with a positive statement. <br/>Sometimes you also use <span class=\"italic\">too</span> to express the same thing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example:<br/><br/><span class=\"strong\">Amanda</span>: <span class=\"italic\">I like this dress!</span></span><br/><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: <span class=\"italic\">So do I./I do too.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"italic\">neither</span>  to show agreement with a negative statement. <br/>Sometimes we also use <span class=\"italic\">either</span> to express the same thing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example:<br/><br/><span class=\"strong\">Amanda</span>:<br/><span class=\"italic\"> I don't think this fits well.</span><br/><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>:<br/><span class=\"italic\">Neither do I. </span>(neither is a negative word)<br/><span class=\"italic\">I don't either. </span>(either is used with the negative)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When you use <span class=\"italic\">so</span> and <span class=\"italic\">neither</span>, the auxiliary verb has to agree with the verb tense that was used in the original statement.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "A more colloquial form of positive agreement is <span class=\"italic\">Me too</span>.<br/>A more colloquial form of   negative agreement is <span class=\"italic\">Me neither</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Statement</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Positive agreement</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I think a jacket would change the look of it as well.<br/><br/>I like them both.<br/><br/>I really loved that.<br/><br/>I think a jacket would change the look of it as well.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I think so too.<br/><br/>Me too!<br/><br/>So did I. <br/><br/> So do I.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Statement</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Negative agreement</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I can't wear this shade of green though.<br/><br/>I don't see myself working in this.<br/><br/>I haven't seen anything else that has looked as good as the first outfit. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Neither can I.<br/><br/>I don't either.<br/><br/>Neither have I.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"content": "engenn8le07ob03re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "slim", "type": "name"}, {"content": "thin", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I don't look as slim as I did last year.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le07ob03aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about clothing.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "rust", "type": "name"}, {"content": "reddish brown", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Green is not as easy to wear as blue or rust or rose.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le07ob03aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "vintage-look", "type": "name"}, {"content": "looks like it was made in the past", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  It's a vintage-look top. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le07ob03aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "boot-cut", "type": "name"}, {"content": "looser at the bottom so boots can go inside", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example : I bought some boot-cut pants.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le07ob03aud04", 