n as ever. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I can't wear this shade of green though.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Neither can I.  Green is not as easy to wear as blue or rust or rose.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I don't see myself working in this.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I don't either.  You need something that is not as fussy as this. I haven't seen anything else that has looked as good as the first outfit.", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn8le07ob03re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Neither have I.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I really loved that.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: So did I. That's a definite. The vintage-look top and boot-cut pants fit well.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: And I thought the price was right as well.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I did too!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: The saleswoman really knows her stuff.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I think so too. She's as good as they get.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Salesperson</span>: These two designer dresses are a wool blend. They're marked down.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I like them both.", "time": "24000", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn8le07ob03re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Me too!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Salesperson</span>: I'll take these to give you as much room as possible.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Thanks.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Wow Sal. That's very modern Lois Lane! If you threw a loose sweater over it, you could really dress it down. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I think a jacket would change the look of it as well.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: So do I.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Salesperson</span>: This leather jacket will toughen it up for that big interview or big date!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Nice! I am having so much fun!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I am too!", "time": "44200", "id": 3}]}}], "_data": []}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "type": "sena"}